# "Target creature you control" (CR 115.1): with only an opponent's Ornithopter to aim at, Price of Beauty is not castable at it,
# but at Bot1's own Memnite it is, and the Memnite (a 1/1 that becomes 2/2 with the Role) is the one that grows.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Conceited Witch
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
! Bot1.Hand.Conceited Witch.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Hand.Conceited Witch.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Exile = Conceited Witch
